sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as GameFlowRunner<br/>(MonoBehaviour)
    participant F as GameFlow
    participant AI as DealerAI
    participant K as DealerKnownInfo
    participant T as TableState
    participant P as PhaseMachine

    Note over F,T: 판 시작 — 딜러 차례면 먼저 뽑고 분배 단계에서 멈춤
    F->>T: DrawForTurnPlayer()
    F->>P: CompleteDraw() → Distribute 단계
    R->>R: Update()에서 "고민 중" 대기 시간 측정
    R->>F: PlayDealerTurn()
    F->>AI: TryDistribute(table, matchIndex)
    AI->>K: new DealerKnownInfo(table, matchIndex)
    K-->>AI: 아는 정보만 담긴 묶음 (모르는 칸 null)
    AI->>AI: ChooseKeep() → ① · ② · ③ → ApplyRandomRatio()
    AI->>T: Distribute(keep)
    F->>P: CompleteDistribute() → 아이템 단계
